        "original_id": "d1ce43ee-91aa-5f24-9919-447431c08ac2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: San Diego, Downtown San Diego, Las Vegas Valley, Nevada, California, United States\n- Organizations: San Diego International Airport, McCarran International Airport, U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego\n- People: Chelsea Chen\n- Concepts: airport codes, organist, composer\n\nFacts:\n- San Diego International Airport is an international airport located 3 miles northwest of Downtown San Diego, California, United States.\n- San Diego International Airport was formerly known as Lindbergh Field.\n- San Diego International Airport has the codes IATA SAN, ICAO KSAN, and FAA LID SAN.\n- McCarran International Airport is the primary commercial airport serving the Las Vegas Valley in Nevada.\n- McCarran International Airport has the codes IATA LAS, ICAO KLAS, and FAA LID LAS.\n- U.S. Coast Guard Air Station San Diego is a Coast Guard air station in San Diego, California, across the street from San Diego International Airport.\n- Chelsea Chen was born on December 30, 1983, in San Diego, California.\n- Chelsea Chen is an American organist and composer.",
